   "race": "Dwarf",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "A Report on the State of wendigo in the caves near Kharanos\r\n\r\nWritten by Mountaineer Gretchen based on the findings of Mountaineer Cornelius\r\n\r\nThe wendigo rarely leave their caves, but there have been reports that they have attacked civilians around nearby settlements such as Kharanos and Brewnall Village. They seem to be growing increasingly agitated as they search for food. We have now lost one of our own to the efforts of containing them. While the full removal of these beasts is impractical, the mountaineers request",
   "time": 1791655322,
   "title": "Mountaineer Gretchen's Report",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Dun Morogh"
  },
  "a59b10c4": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Hunter",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "page",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1426,
   "name": null,
   "npc": null,
   "page": 2,
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Dwarf",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "additional resources to limit their spread. We can't continue to rely on throwing adventurers at the problem and hope for the best. Sooner or later the food will run out, and the wendigo will be forced to attack our cities directly. Maybe even Ironforge itself.\r\n\r\nPlease offer my condolences to the family of Mountaineer Cornelius, who bravely fought to keep the people of Dun Morogh safe.",
   "time": 1791655324,
   "title": "Mountaineer Gretchen's Report",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Dun Morogh"
  }
 },
